---
// Reviews Component
---
<section id="reviews" class="bg-brand-navy dark:bg-[#050B14] py-24 sm:py-32 overflow-hidden relative transition-colors duration-500">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-green/10 text-brand-green px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 border border-brand-green/20">
          Depoimentos
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl font-display">
          O que dizem nossos clientes em <span class="text-brand-green italic font-medium">Blumenau</span>.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          A satisfação de quem já utilizou nossos serviços é a nossa maior garantia. Atuamos com transparência e respeito em cada residência que entramos.
        </p>
        
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
          <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=Fix+Servi%C3%A7os+e+Reparos+Blumenau#lrd=0x94df1bfadf80214f:0x86448d8461bc8be4,1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-brand-green/10 border border-brand-green/20 text-white/90 font-medium group hover:scale-105 transition-transform cursor-pointer">
            <!-- Google Logo SVG -->
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="20px" height="20px" class="flex-shrink-0">
              <path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/>
              <path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6c4.51-4.18 7.09-10.36 7.09-17.65z"/>
              <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/>
              <path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/>
              <path fill="none" d="M0 0h48v48H0z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Média 5 estrelas no <strong class="font-bold">Google</strong></span>
          </a>

          {[
            "Referência em rapidez e limpeza na cidade",
            "Garantia estendida em todos os serviços"
          ].map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-white/90 font-medium group">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-brand-green/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-brand-green/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check text-brand-green"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              </div>
              {item}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Review 1 -->
        <div class="bg-brand-navy-mid/40 dark:bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-green/50 hover:translate-y-[-4px] shadow-lg group">
          <div class="flex gap-1 text-yellow-500 mb-4 items-center">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star fill-yellow-500 text-yellow-500"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-white/90 italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "O serviço de eletricista foi excelente. Chegou no horário, resolveu o curto-circuito rápido e deixou tudo limpo. Recomendo muito!"
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand-green/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-green font-bold border border-brand-green/20 group-hover:bg-brand-green group-hover:text-white transition-colors">R</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Ricardo Silva</p>
              <p class="text-white/70 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Bairro Victor Konder</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Review 2 -->
        <div class="bg-brand-navy-mid/40 dark:bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-2xl sm:mt-12 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-green/50 hover:translate-y-[-4px] shadow-lg group">
          <div class="flex gap-1 text-yellow-500 mb-4 items-center">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star fill-yellow-500 text-yellow-500"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-white/90 italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "Instalaram o suporte da minha TV de 65 polegadas em Blumenau. Serviço impecável, furos precisos e sem sujeira. Nota 10!"
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 font-bold border border-blue-500/20 group-hover:bg-blue-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">M</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Mariana Costa</p>
              <p class="text-white/70 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Bairro Vila Nova</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Review 3 -->
        <div class="bg-brand-navy-mid/40 dark:bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-green/50 hover:translate-y-[-4px] shadow-lg group">
          <div class="flex gap-1 text-yellow-500 mb-4 items-center">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star fill-yellow-500 text-yellow-500"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-white/90 italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "Precisava de um reparo hidráulico urgente no finde. Foram os únicos que me atenderam com agilidade aqui no Centro. Gratidão!"
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 font-bold border border-purple-500/20 group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">P</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Pedro Santos</p>
              <p class="text-white/70 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Centro</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Review 4 -->
        <div class="bg-brand-navy-mid/40 dark:bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-2xl sm:mt-12 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-green/50 hover:translate-y-[-4px] shadow-lg group">
          <div class="flex gap-1 text-yellow-500 mb-4 items-center">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star fill-yellow-500 text-yellow-500"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-white/90 italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "Marido de aluguel completo. Trocaram chuveiro, torneira e arrumaram a fiação. Preço justo e trabalho muito honesto."
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-400 font-bold border border-orange-500/20 group-hover:bg-orange-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">A</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Ana Paula</p>
              <p class="text-white/70 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Bairro Itoupava Norte</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Ambient Glows - Differentiated by theme -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-brand-green/10 blur-[120px] dark:bg-brand-green/20 dark:blur-[150px] transition-all duration-700"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 blur-[120px] dark:bg-purple-500/15 dark:blur-[150px] transition-all duration-700"></div>
</section>
